OL,3,GNEWSANew sports courts honour local
OL,4,Anetball legend
OL,5,
OL,6,FA netball coach has said she feels
OL,7,F"humbled" and "staggered" that a new
OL,8,Fcommunity sports facility has been
OL,9,Fnamed after her.
OL,11,FVal Kennedy was a member of Haxby
OL,12,FNetball Club for more than four
OL,13,Fdecades, and has helped generations of
OL,14,Fwomen and girls to get involved in the
OL,15,Fsport.
OL,17,FAlong with Haxby Runners, Haxby Town FC
OL,18,Fand Haxby Town JFC, the netball team
OL,19,Fwill benefit from a modern accessible
OL,20,Fmulti-sport facility at Ethel Ward
OL,21,FPlaying Fields, which will help people
OL,22,Fof all ages to get active.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,388,380,200,160,0,100
