OL,3,GNEWSANew sports courts honour local
OL,4,Anetball legend
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe clubs worked with local businesses,
OL,7,Fvolunteers, Haxby Town Council and
OL,8,Ffunding partners to transform what were
OL,9,Fdeteriorating netball courts into a
OL,10,Fsafe and accessible facility.
